+### OAuth token endpoint admission
+
+Set `OAUTH_TOKEN_IP_RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED: false` in `.env.yaml` or set the
+same environment variable to `false` when the deployment enforces its request
+budget upstream or when running an isolated benchmark. The token, introspection,
+and revocation endpoints skip their source-IP quota and counter writes. OAuth
+client authentication and protocol validation still apply. Authentication, PAR,
+dynamic registration, device authorization, and SCIM keep their own admission
+checks, including routes that share a counter with introspection and revocation.
+
 ### SCIM denied-credential admission
 
 `SCIM_DENIAL_RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS` defaults to 60 denied attempts per source
